(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-gateway/tests/cockpitTest.asl#" :text "Replays tests/cockpitFixture.asn (recorded from bin/asl-gateway at a614a0b9 by tests/parity/gateway/genCockpitFixture.py) through the ASL cockpit port: byte-identical HTML, equal JSON data, equal bin/asl intel argv logs")
