(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-gateway/src/balancer.asl#" :text "GW-BUDGET-BALANCER-20261027: pure model-pool balancer over a fake or real clock; every configured model is routable, scored by quality from the best source with a confidence, paced per budget window, shifted at soft lines and refused at hard caps; costs are Int64 microUSD.")
