(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-gateway/src/balancer.asl#Policy" :text "mode, exploreEvery (every n-th request goes to the least calibrated fitting model, 0 is off) and softFactor (permille scale applied past a soft line)")
(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-gateway/src/balancer.asl#Balancer" :text "models, budgets by id, calibration rows and policy, and calAs: per alias the other names its calibration rows carry (model row :calAs list, e.g. worker model names in workerStats)")
