(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-gateway/src/balancer.asl#pacingFactor" :text "permille pacing of one budget: squared ratio of pro-rata target to use, raised only for use-or-lose quotas, scaled by softFactor past the soft line (absolute soft cap or ahead of hard pro-rata) except late in a use-or-lose window, x1.5 for a use-or-lose quota under 90% in its last quarter")
(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-gateway/src/balancer.asl#modelPacing" :text "tightest pacing factor over a model's budgets, 1000 when it has none")
